Pair representation scaling for Boltz-2.

Upstream: https://github.com/jwohlwend/boltz at tag v2.2.1
          (commit cb04aeccdd480fd4db707f0bbafde538397fa2ac)

Adds a --beta option to `boltz predict` and multiplies the pair representation
by (1 + beta) once before the Pairformer stack. beta = 0 reproduces stock
inference. The prs CLI applies the same scaling at runtime, so this patch is
only needed to modify a Boltz-2 checkout directly.

Apply from the Boltz-2 repository root:

    git apply -p1 patches/boltz-2.2.1.patch

